flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read string S/]
    B --> C[left ← 0, right ← length of S − 1]
    C --> D{left < right?}
    D -->|Yes| E{Characters at left and right match?}
    E -->|No| F[/Print Not a palindrome/]
    F --> Z([Stop])
    E -->|Yes| G[left ← left + 1]
    G --> H[right ← right − 1]
    H --> D
    D -->|No| I[/Print Palindrome/]
    I --> Z
